            "review_text": "Misskay92\nNyc1 contribution\n0\nFresh & Healthy Juices in HCMC!\nJul 2014 • Friends\nMy friends and I stayed at a hotel just steps away from Fresh box. We went came here to get juices/shakes almost every single day during our month-long stay in HCMC. The juices and shakes here are fresh, healthy, delicious, and affordable! The staff at Fresh Box is just as great. All of them are friendly, helpful, and genuinely kind. They even threw us a farewell party for the 6 of us. Fresh box is full nice people working together to deliver great service and products!!!\n\n - Kristie, Maria, Thomas, Tom, Linda, Jess\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 29, 2014",
